export anchor SwissGridStyle:
    number: 5
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Swiss grid
    idea: A strict twelve column grid in black Helvetica on white, where huge flush left numbers, rules and alignment carry everything and one signal red marks what needs action.
    base: light
    palette:
        white: #ffffff, the only background
        black: #000000, text, rules, numbers, the primary button and this week's bars
        grey: #595959, meta text, dates and axis labels
        midGrey: #8a8a8a, last week's chart bars only, never text
        hairline: #c8c8c8, row rules and progress tracks
        signalRed: #d0021b, the overdue fact, the Behind status, the peak day and the focus ring
    type:
        Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, Nimbus Sans, Liberation Sans,
        sans-serif, in weights 400 and 700 only. Summary figures are 128px
        bold at 0.9 line height with minus 0.05em tracking, the greeting
        is 72px bold with tight tracking, section titles are 28px bold,
        project names 17px bold, body 15px at 1.45 and labels 13px bold in
        lowercase.
    layout:
        A twelve column grid with 24px gutters, 40px margins and a 1320px
        cap. The head row puts the lowercase wordmark with a small red
        square in columns 1 to 3, text nav in 4 to 9 and notifications in
        10 to 12. A 2px rule opens a second row with an underlined search,
        the user name and the black New project button. The greeting sits
        in columns 4 to 12 with the date in 1 to 3. Four huge figures span
        three columns each under a 2px rule. Every section after that puts
        its title and a short note in columns 1 to 3 and content in 4 to
        12, with a ruled projects table, then a thin bar chart beside an
        activity list. Below 720px all columns stack and the figures form
        a two by two grid.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 72px between sections, 14px row padding, 24px gutters.
    density: Medium. Few elements, very large figures and generous white space.
    corners: None. Every edge is square.
    borders: No boxes at all. A 2px black rule opens each block and table head, 1px #c8c8c8 rules separate rows, and an 8px black rule opens the style sheet.
    shadows: None.
    icons:
        No pictograms. Status is a 10px solid geometric mark beside the
        word, a circle for On track, a triangle for At risk and a square
        for Behind, with Behind set in bold red. Progress is a 2px track
        with a 4px black fill and the percent beside it.
    focus: A 2px signal red outline offset 2px. A focused field gets a 2px red underline.
    tone: Plain and factual, lowercase labels such as tasks due this week, sentence case headings and no exclamation marks.
